  "text": "HE HO CORN I LATE\nSYDNEY\nMS.\nBOX 544 G.P.O.\n4 BRIDGE STREET,\nSYDNEY.\n9th June, 1955.\nDear Mr. McFadyen,\nMay I on behalf of the Dir-\nectors of this Company offer you our sincere\ncongratulations on the Honour which has been\nconferred upon you by the Queen.\nWith all best wishes for\nthe future,\n(W. ES\nc.H. McFadyen, Esq., C.B.E.\nSecretary,\nDepartment of Shipping & Transport,\nCANBERRA. A.C.I.\n\" RENCHN.\nH.M.S. RENOWN IN SYRNEY HARBOUR 8•8•20",
